pageType: final
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$ink"
notes: 收尾 15 秒：核心价值一句话——让普通人在签合同前，花 30 秒贴进来，就能快速知道哪里可能吃亏。然后切到现场演示。
elements:
  - elementId: deco-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [798, 128, 84, 84]
    iconName: "fas:file-signature"
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$brass"}
  - elementId: manifesto
    elementType: text
    bounds: [78, 150, 680, 140]
    content:
      fontSize: 40
      bold: true
      color: "$base"
      lineHeight: 1.45
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>签字之前，</p>
        <p>先花 30 秒知道哪里可能吃亏。</p>
  - elementId: m-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [84, 316, 96, 3]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$brass"}
  - elementId: demo-cue
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 340, 400, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      bold: true
      color: "$brass"
      wrap: false
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 接下来：现场演示 →
  - elementId: disclaimer
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 476, 760, 32]
    content:
      fontSize: 10
      color: "$paleText"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>本工具结果由 AI 生成，仅用于风险提示，不构成法律意见；重要合同请咨询专业律师。</p>
